{"id": "s-0101", "domain": "ecosystem", "names": ["Pond", "Frog", "Fly"], "text": "I'm drawing a pond ecosystem for my little brother. Please add an arrow from Fly to Frog, because the frog eats the fly, and make the Pond big and cyan. What colour is the Frog right now, and what rules are you following for new shapes?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Fly", "to": "Frog"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Pond", "size": "large", "color": "cyan"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "property", "target": "Frog", "property": "color"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "rules"}}]}
{"id": "s-0102", "domain": "startup org", "names": ["Founder", "Dev", "Design"], "text": "Okay, we are four people, so I need one more box. Create a rectangle named Ops below Founder, coloured gray, and attach it to Founder with an arrow. Dev and Design should also hang from Founder, I forgot those. Does Founder have three connections then?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "rectangle", "color": "gray", "name": "Ops", "position": "below", "anchor": "Founder"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Founder", "to": "$new"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Founder", "to": "Dev,Design"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "degree", "target": "Founder"}}]}
{"id": "s-0103", "domain": "ci pipeline", "names": ["Lint", "Unit", "Package"], "text": "Lint then Unit then Package, you know the drill. Chain them left to right. If Unit is red it blocks the release, so go ahead and paint Unit red. Then get rid of Package, we are building that by hand now.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Lint,Unit,Package", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Unit", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "delete", "target": "Package"}}]}
{"id": "s-0104", "domain": "space mission", "names": ["Earth", "Probe", "Comet"], "text": "The probe leaves Earth and chases the Comet, so I want an arrow from Earth to Probe and another from Probe to Comet. Both should be dashed. The Comet is small and white, please make it so. Is the Comet the farthest thing from Earth?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Earth,Probe,Comet", "pairing": "chain", "style": "dashed"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Comet", "size": "small", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "Earth", "superlative": "farthest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0105", "domain": "hotel", "names": ["Lobby", "Pool", "Spa"], "text": "Pop the Spa down below the Pool, it should be quiet there. Then paint the Spa purple, and the Pool cyan. I'd like to hear if the Lobby is above the Pool, since guests have to see the entrance first.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Spa", "position": "below", "anchor": "Pool"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Spa", "color": "purple"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Pool", "color": "cyan"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Lobby", "position": "above", "anchor": "Pool"}}]}
{"id": "s-0106", "domain": "courier routes", "names": ["Depot", "Stop1", "Stop2"], "text": "Ok so, Depot to Stop1 and then from Stop1 to Stop2, drawn as arrows. Tie Stop2 back to Depot too so the van returns. That makes a loop, right? Show me if there is a cycle.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Depot,Stop1,Stop2", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Stop2", "to": "Depot"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "cycle"}}]}
{"id": "s-0107", "domain": "farm", "names": ["Barn", "Silo", "Field"], "text": "From now on every square must be brown, farm buildings are all wood. Make a square called Coop right of the Barn. Then also create a second one named Pen above the Field. Which squares are there?", "wires": [{"type": "rule", "args": {"shape": "square", "color": "brown"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "square", "name": "Coop", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Barn"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "square", "name": "Pen", "position": "above", "anchor": "Field"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "list", "shape": "square"}}]}
{"id": "s-0108", "domain": "esports", "names": ["TeamA", "TeamB", "Arena"], "text": "TeamA plays TeamB in the Arena. Link TeamA and TeamB with a two-way line, then put the Arena between them. I want TeamA blue and TeamB red, as in the poster. Is TeamB to the right of TeamA?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "TeamA", "to": "TeamB", "arrow": "both"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Arena", "position": "between", "anchor": "TeamA,TeamB"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "TeamA", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "TeamB", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "TeamB", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "TeamA"}}]}
{"id": "s-0109", "domain": "bank", "names": ["Teller", "Vault", "Manager"], "text": "Teller goes to Manager for approval, and the Manager has the Vault key. Connect them in that order, please. The Vault needs to be huge and navy, it is the heaviest object in the building. And what is the leftmost shape?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Teller,Manager,Vault", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Vault", "size": "huge", "color": "navy"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "leftmost"}}]}
{"id": "s-0110", "domain": "weather", "names": ["Cloud", "Sun", "Rain"], "text": "Teacher said to show how weather works. So I want the Sun to be yellow, the Cloud to be gray, and the Rain to be blue. After that, link Cloud to Rain with an arrow. Can you also make a list of all the blue shapes?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Sun", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Cloud", "color": "gray"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Rain", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Cloud", "to": "Rain"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "list", "color": "blue"}}]}
{"id": "s-0111", "domain": "restaurant", "names": ["Order", "Cook", "Serve"], "text": "yeah so the Cook box needs to be bigger and the Serve box smaller, the cook has way more to do. also wire Order into Cook, uh, and Cook into Serve. then make Serve orange. is there a path from Order to Serve?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Cook"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Serve"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Order,Cook,Serve", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Serve", "color": "orange"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "path", "from": "Order", "to": "Serve"}}]}
{"id": "s-0112", "domain": "museum", "names": ["Hall1", "Hall2", "Shop"], "text": "We need to stack Hall1 and Hall2 in a column and put the Shop on the right. Make the Shop gold, because that's the gift shop. Then undo the last step, my mistake. Is the Shop golden or not?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Hall1,Hall2", "layout": "column"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Shop", "position": "right"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Shop", "color": "gold"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "undo"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Shop", "color": "gold"}}]}
{"id": "s-0113", "domain": "database", "names": ["Users", "Posts", "Tags"], "text": "Users has many Posts, so draw an arrow from Users to Posts. Posts and Tags are linked both ways. I'd make Tags teal and then rename it to Labels, it's less ambiguous. Who are the neighbors of Posts?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Users", "to": "Posts"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Posts", "to": "Tags", "arrow": "both"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Tags", "color": "teal"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "rename", "target": "Tags", "name": "Labels"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "neighbors", "target": "Posts"}}]}
{"id": "s-0114", "domain": "volcano", "names": ["Magma", "Crater", "Ash"], "text": "Science fair poster. The Magma is red, the Crater is brown and the Ash is gray, no exceptions. Now drop the Ash above the Crater and connect Magma to Crater with an arrow. Is anything orange?", "wires": [{"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Magma", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Crater", "color": "brown"}}, {"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Ash", "color": "gray"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Ash", "position": "above", "anchor": "Crater"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Magma", "to": "Crater"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "exists", "color": "orange"}}]}
{"id": "s-0115", "domain": "mobile app", "names": ["Home", "Search", "Settings"], "text": "Home is the first screen, so put it at the top left. Search should be to the right of Home and Settings below Home. I know the layout is cramped, but we will fix that later. Make all three of them rectangles, ok?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Home", "position": "topLeft"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Search", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Home"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Settings", "position": "below", "anchor": "Home"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Home,Search,Settings", "shape": "rectangle"}}]}
{"id": "s-0116", "domain": "history timeline", "names": ["Rome", "Empire", "Fall"], "text": "Rome led to Empire, and Empire led to Fall: arrows, please. Give the Fall a dotted outline... I mean a dotted connection from Empire to it instead. Make the Rome star-shaped and gold, and tell me which shape is the rightmost.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Rome", "to": "Empire"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Empire", "to": "Fall", "style": "dotted"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Rome", "shape": "star", "color": "gold"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "rightmost"}}]}
{"id": "s-0117", "domain": "network diagram", "names": ["Sw1", "Sw2", "Sw3"], "text": "I need Sw1, Sw2 and Sw3 equally spaced horizontally; the rack picture looks wonky now. Align them first, then distribute them. After that, throw a pink hexagon called Uplink at the top, and join Sw2 with it.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "align", "target": "Sw1,Sw2,Sw3", "axis": "horizontal"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "distribute", "target": "Sw1,Sw2,Sw3", "axis": "horizontal"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "hexagon", "color": "pink", "name": "Uplink", "position": "top"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Sw2", "to": "$new"}}]}
{"id": "s-0118", "domain": "cell biology", "names": ["Dna", "Rna", "Protein"], "text": "Central dogma, folks. DNA makes RNA and RNA makes protein, so Dna to Rna to Protein with arrows. Make Dna indigo and Protein lime. Then give me a description of the Rna shape, if you can.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Dna,Rna,Protein", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Dna", "color": "indigo"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Protein", "color": "lime"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "describe", "target": "Rna"}}]}
{"id": "s-0119", "domain": "retail", "names": ["Cart", "Checkout", "Receipt"], "text": "Cart goes into Checkout. Receipt comes out of Checkout. Do both arrows, the second one is a dashed. The Cart looks lonely so create 3 tiny yellow circles near it, they are the items. How many circles exist after that?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Cart", "to": "Checkout"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Checkout", "to": "Receipt", "style": "dashed"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "circle", "color": "yellow", "size": "tiny", "count": "3", "position": "near", "anchor": "Cart"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "shape": "circle"}}]}
{"id": "s-0120", "domain": "classroom", "names": ["Teacher", "Board", "Door"], "text": "Teacher sits in front of the Board, so put the Teacher above the Board. The Door goes in the bottom right corner. If the Board is not the biggest shape yet, make it huge. By the way, which shape is the biggest right now?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Teacher", "position": "above", "anchor": "Board"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Door", "position": "bottomRight"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Board", "size": "huge"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "biggest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0121", "domain": "microservices", "names": ["Auth", "Billing", "Mail"], "text": "Nudge Billing right by 120 pixels, then nudge Mail down 20. They collided on the last render. Also swap Auth and Billing, the order of the tiers was wrong. Finally, bring Mail to the front.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Billing", "direction": "right", "distance": "120"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Mail", "direction": "down", "distance": "20"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "swap", "target": "Auth,Billing"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "toFront", "target": "Mail"}}]}
{"id": "s-0122", "domain": "cooking", "names": ["Eggs", "Pan", "Plate"], "text": "Breakfast flowchart for my roommate who can't cook. Eggs go in the Pan, then the Pan goes to the Plate. Make the Pan red hot, I mean red, and make the Plate white. Does the Plate connect to the Eggs directly? I doubt it.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Eggs,Pan,Plate", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Pan", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Plate", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "connected", "target": "Plate", "anchor": "Eggs"}}]}
{"id": "s-0123", "domain": "circuit", "names": ["Node1", "Node2", "Node3", "Node4"], "text": "Make a ring with the four nodes. Arrange them in a circle, then connect Node1 to Node2, Node2 to Node3, Node3 to Node4 and Node4 to Node1. Colour the whole thing orange after that. I want to know whether this is a cycle.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Node1,Node2,Node3,Node4", "layout": "circle"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Node1,Node2,Node3,Node4,Node1", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "mention(quantifier=all)", "color": "orange"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "cycle"}}]}
{"id": "s-0124", "domain": "cinema", "names": ["Screen", "Seats", "Exit"], "text": "Screen goes at the top. Seats goes below it, and make the Seats wide, like a big rectangle. Exit goes bottom right, tiny and green. Which is nearer to Seats, the Screen or the Exit?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Screen", "position": "top"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Seats", "position": "below", "anchor": "Screen"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Seats", "shape": "rectangle", "size": "large"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Exit", "position": "bottomRight"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Exit", "size": "tiny", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "Seats", "superlative": "closest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0125", "domain": "chemistry", "names": ["Water", "Salt", "Mix"], "text": "Dissolve the salt in water, as they say: connect Water to Mix and Salt to Mix. Mix should be cyan and a bit larger than the other two. By the way, forget my old default rules, I don't need them anymore. What are the rules now?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Water,Salt", "to": "Mix"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Mix", "color": "cyan"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Mix"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "forget"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "rules"}}]}
{"id": "s-0126", "domain": "personal finance", "names": ["Salary", "Rent", "Savings"], "text": "My money flows from Salary to Rent and from Salary to Savings. Draw it with arrows. Savings in green please, Rent in red, the usual. Which shape does the most connecting?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Salary", "to": "Rent,Savings"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Savings", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Rent", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "mostConnected"}}]}
{"id": "s-0127", "domain": "space station", "names": ["Core", "Lab", "Dock"], "text": "Attach the Lab to the left of the Core and the Dock to the right. Plain lines, no arrowheads, since it is all docking tubes. Lab should be a hexagon and white. Is the Dock reachable from the Lab?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Lab", "position": "leftOf", "anchor": "Core"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Dock", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Core"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Lab", "to": "Core", "arrow": "none"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Core", "to": "Dock", "arrow": "none"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Lab", "shape": "hexagon", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "reachable", "from": "Lab"}}]}
{"id": "s-0128", "domain": "theme park", "names": ["Coaster", "Ferris", "Food"], "text": "Colour Coaster red, Ferris yellow and Food orange. Then take Food and put it right next to Ferris, since people get hungry. Delete the Coaster? No, wait. Keep it. Make it bigger instead.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Coaster", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Ferris", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Food", "color": "orange"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Food", "position": "near", "anchor": "Ferris"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Coaster"}}]}
{"id": "s-0129", "domain": "software release", "names": ["Dev", "Stage", "Prod"], "text": "Prod is the one that must never break, so make it large and green. Dev is the playground, make it small and lime. Draw arrows Dev to Stage and Stage to Prod. Does anything link Prod back to Dev?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Prod", "size": "large", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Dev", "size": "small", "color": "lime"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Dev,Stage,Prod", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "connected", "target": "Prod", "anchor": "Dev"}}]}
{"id": "s-0130", "domain": "genetics", "names": ["Aa", "Bb"], "text": "We cross Aa with Bb. Create 2 offspring circles in magenta, below the Aa. Then link both parents to the new ones. Hmm, okay, just link Aa to them for now. How many magenta shapes are there?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "circle", "color": "magenta", "count": "2", "position": "below", "anchor": "Aa"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Aa", "to": "mention(quantifier=all,recency=newest)"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "color": "magenta"}}]}
{"id": "s-0131", "domain": "city planning", "names": ["Park", "School", "Mall"], "text": "The School should not be near the Mall, move it to the bottom left. Park goes in the middle of the map, so move it to the center. The Mall can be indigo and huge. Is the School the smallest?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "School", "position": "bottomLeft"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Park", "position": "center"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Mall", "color": "indigo", "size": "huge"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "smallest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0132", "domain": "kanban board", "names": ["Wip", "Qa", "Live"], "text": "Make a duplicate of the Wip card, then colour the copy yellow, it's a reminder. Connect Wip to Qa and Qa to Live, chain style. What does the duplicate sit near?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "duplicate", "target": "Wip"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "$new", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Wip,Qa,Live", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "$new", "superlative": "closest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0133", "domain": "transport", "names": ["Airport", "Rail", "Port"], "text": "Link Airport, Rail and Port in a chain, with lines that go both ways. Rail should stand in the middle, so line it up with them on the same vertical line. Which of the three has the highest degree?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Airport,Rail,Port", "pairing": "chain", "arrow": "both"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "align", "target": "Airport,Rail,Port", "axis": "vertical"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "mostConnected"}}]}
{"id": "s-0134", "domain": "school diagram", "names": ["Moon", "Earth", "Sun"], "text": "Teach the kids about orbits. Moon around Earth, Earth around Sun, so use two dashed arrows pointing to the thing they orbit. Moon is gray and tiny, Earth is blue and small. Is the Sun bigger than the Earth?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Moon,Earth,Sun", "pairing": "chain", "style": "dashed"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Moon", "color": "gray", "size": "tiny"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Earth", "color": "blue", "size": "small"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Sun", "comparison": "bigger", "anchor": "Earth"}}]}
{"id": "s-0135", "domain": "event flow", "names": ["Invite", "Rsvp", "Party"], "text": "Redo what I just undid, please. Then connect Invite to Rsvp and Rsvp to Party, as plain arrows. Put a huge star called Cake on top of the canvas; the whole party is about it.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "redo"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Invite,Rsvp,Party", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "star", "size": "huge", "name": "Cake", "position": "top"}}]}
{"id": "s-0136", "domain": "UI wireframe", "names": ["Modal", "Close", "Body"], "text": "Modal is the big window, so enlarge it and send it to the back. The Close button belongs at the top right, in red. The Body should be below the close button. Describe the diagram for me once you're done.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Modal"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "toBack", "target": "Modal"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Close", "position": "topRight"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Close", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Body", "position": "below", "anchor": "Close"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "describe"}}]}
{"id": "s-0137", "domain": "mythology", "names": ["Zeus", "Hera", "Ares"], "text": "Zeus and Hera are the parents of Ares, believe it or not. Connect Zeus to Ares and Hera to Ares. The Ares one should be red, he's the god of war. Which shapes are red?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Zeus,Hera", "to": "Ares"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Ares", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "list", "color": "red"}}]}
{"id": "s-0138", "domain": "photography", "names": ["Camera", "Lens", "Flash"], "text": "Camera has a Lens and a Flash, so link the Camera to both of them. The Lens needs to be a circle. The Flash should be a small yellow star. Is the Flash directly connected to the Lens?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Camera", "to": "Lens,Flash"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Lens", "shape": "circle"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Flash", "shape": "star", "size": "small", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "connected", "target": "Flash", "anchor": "Lens"}}]}
{"id": "s-0139", "domain": "logistics", "names": ["Truck", "Ship", "Plane"], "text": "Group the vehicles in a grid and colour all of them teal, it's our brand colour. Then give the Ship the label \"slow\" and the Plane the label \"fast\". Is there a cycle?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Truck,Ship,Plane", "layout": "grid"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Truck,Ship,Plane", "color": "teal"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "label", "target": "Ship", "label": "slow"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "label", "target": "Plane", "label": "fast"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "cycle"}}]}
{"id": "s-0140", "domain": "mind map", "names": ["Hobbies"], "text": "I'm starting a mind map about my hobbies. Create 4 small circles in different spots, then arrange them all in a circle around the central Hobbies one. Hook each of them up to Hobbies with plain lines. How many shapes do I have in total?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "circle", "size": "small", "count": "4"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "mention(quantifier=all,recency=newest)", "layout": "circle"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Hobbies", "to": "mention(quantifier=all,recency=newest)", "arrow": "none"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count"}}]}
{"id": "s-0141", "domain": "construction", "names": ["Crane", "Site", "Truck"], "text": "Swap the Crane and the Truck, the picture mirrors the real site. Then colour Crane gold and move it a little, say 50 pixels up. What is the topmost shape now?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "swap", "target": "Crane,Truck"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Crane", "color": "gold"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Crane", "direction": "up", "distance": "50"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "topmost"}}]}
{"id": "s-0142", "domain": "first aid", "names": ["Check", "Call", "Cpr"], "text": "The sequence is Check, Call, Cpr. Put them in a row and chain with arrows. I want Call to be a diamond, since it is a decision. Also paint Cpr red, it's an emergency. What shape is Call now?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Check,Call,Cpr", "layout": "row"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Check,Call,Cpr", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Call", "shape": "diamond"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Cpr", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "property", "target": "Call", "property": "shape"}}]}
{"id": "s-0143", "domain": "sports", "names": ["Goal", "Ball", "Player"], "text": "Ball near the Goal, Player a bit to the left of it. Ball is small and white, Goal is large and gray. I'm using it as a play board. Is the Player to the left of the Goal?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Ball", "position": "near", "anchor": "Goal"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Player", "position": "leftOf", "anchor": "Goal"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Ball", "size": "small", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Goal", "size": "large", "color": "gray"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Player", "position": "leftOf", "anchor": "Goal"}}]}
{"id": "s-0144", "domain": "it support", "names": ["Ticket", "Triage", "Fix"], "text": "A Ticket arrives, Triage looks at it, then Fix happens. Connect these as a chain. Replace Triage's colour with orange, it's the bottleneck. And disconnect Triage from Fix, I'll rethink that bit. Does the Fix have any neighbors?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Ticket,Triage,Fix", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Triage", "color": "orange"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "disconnect", "from": "Triage", "to": "Fix"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "neighbors", "target": "Fix"}}]}
{"id": "s-0145", "domain": "aquarium", "names": ["Tank", "Shark", "Fish"], "text": "All the fish should be orange. Make a rule for that, new ellipses will be orange from now on. Then add an ellipse called Nemo near the Tank, and a huge navy one called Shark2 above it. Tell me which ellipses we have.", "wires": [{"type": "rule", "args": {"shape": "ellipse", "color": "orange"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "ellipse", "name": "Nemo", "position": "near", "anchor": "Tank"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "ellipse", "color": "navy", "size": "huge", "name": "Shark2", "position": "above", "anchor": "Nemo"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "list", "shape": "ellipse"}}]}
{"id": "s-0146", "domain": "call center", "names": ["Caller", "Ivr", "Agent"], "text": "A caller reaches the IVR menu, then an agent picks up. Draw it Caller to Ivr to Agent. If the wait is long, we lose them, so paint the Ivr yellow. Also nobody should be in the way, so move the Agent to the bottom. How many arrows did we draw?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Caller,Ivr,Agent", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Ivr", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Agent", "position": "bottom"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "kind": "edge"}}]}
{"id": "s-0147", "domain": "botany", "names": ["Seed", "Sprout", "Tree"], "text": "The seed becomes a sprout, and the sprout becomes a tree. Connect these three, please. Colour the Tree green and make it huge. The Seed should be brown and tiny. Are there any green shapes at all?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Seed,Sprout,Tree", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Tree", "color": "green", "size": "huge"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Seed", "color": "brown", "size": "tiny"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "exists", "color": "green"}}]}
{"id": "s-0148", "domain": "payment flow", "names": ["Card", "Gateway", "Bank"], "text": "Card, Gateway, Bank. The standard line. Draw it as a chain with a label on the first link saying \"auth\". Put a red diamond named Decline below Gateway, and link Gateway to it. Is there a path from Card to Decline?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Card,Gateway,Bank", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Card", "to": "Gateway", "label": "auth"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "diamond", "color": "red", "name": "Decline", "position": "below", "anchor": "Gateway"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Gateway", "to": "$new"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "path", "from": "Card", "to": "Decline"}}]}
{"id": "s-0149", "domain": "classroom", "names": ["Alice", "Bob", "Cleo", "Dan"], "text": "Seating chart! Put the four kids into a 2 by 2 grid. Alice and Bob talk too much, so tell me whether they are near each other. Cleo gets a purple colour and Dan gets lime.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Alice,Bob,Cleo,Dan", "layout": "grid"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Alice", "position": "near", "anchor": "Bob"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Cleo", "color": "purple"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Dan", "color": "lime"}}]}
{"id": "s-0150", "domain": "travel", "names": ["Paris", "Rome", "Berlin"], "text": "Route: Paris, then Rome, then Berlin. I want dotted arrows between them since it's only a plan. Rome is the long stop, so make it large. Remove the Berlin entry actually, I can't make it. What's left on the canvas?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Paris,Rome,Berlin", "pairing": "chain", "style": "dotted"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Rome", "size": "large"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "delete", "target": "Berlin"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "list"}}]}
